# Content scripts

## Load order (manifest)

Job origins: `page-context.js` → `humanise.js` → `file-upload.js` → **platform script** → `detector.js` → `job-widget.js`. Indeed and LinkedIn each have one manifest entry with platform script before detector (no split entries).

## Modules

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `page-context.js` | `window.blitzPageContext.analyze()` — `single_job` / `job_list` / `search`; sets `canCapture` |
| `job-widget.js` | Floating panel (shadow DOM); `WIDGET_GENERATE`, refresh job |
| `detector.js` | Platform detect, `JOB_DETECTED`, `GET_TAB_JOB_INFO`, `FILL_FORM` / `SCRAPE_JOB` |
| `humanise.js` | `window.blitzHumanise` — typing, clicks, native value setter for React |
| `file-upload.js` | Attach PDF/base64 to file inputs |
| `job-posting-jsonld.js` | Shared `JobPosting` JSON-LD parse for Lever/Ashby |
| `greenhouse.js` / `linkedin.js` / `indeed.js` / `workday.js` / `lever.js` / `ashby.js` / `bamboohr.js` | `scrapeJob()`, `fillForm(payload)` on `window.blitz*` |

## Fill payload

`{ tailoredCV, coverLetter, screeningAnswers, userProfile, pdfBase64?, autoSubmit? }`

## Platform notes

- **LinkedIn**: multi-step Easy Apply modal; click Apply on fill; optional `autoSubmit`
- **Indeed**: block `externalApply` redirects; widget on `/jobs`, `viewjob`, `jk`/`vjk`, `smartapply.*`, `/rc/clk`; SPA via `watchSpaNavigation`
- **Workday**: `queryDeep()` for Shadow DOM; `scanFillReadiness()` + fill report (`fillDiagnostics`) for Review diagnostics
- **Greenhouse**: `DataTransfer` for resume upload
- **Lever**: `jobs.lever.co` / `jobs.eu.lever.co`; `name`/`email`/`resume` fields; JSON-LD fallback
- **Ashby**: `jobs.ashbyhq.com`; cross-origin embed iframe → `externalApply` / tailor-only (no fill)

## Messages handled in content

`SCRAPE_JOB`, `FILL_FORM`, `GET_TAB_JOB_INFO` (returns `{ context, jobData, platform }` for tab queue), `WIDGET_REFRESH_JOB`

## Do not

- Call AI APIs from content scripts
- Auto-fill without `FILL_FORM` message (detect/scrape only on page load)
